        "id": 40842,
        "name": "TheJayMann",
        "username": "TheJayMann",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-10-25T16:59:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Enhanced edition = 10 heroes * 41 cards + 4 villains * 27 cards + 4 env * 15 cards = 578 cards</p><p>Core = same as Enhanced edition, 578 (mostly the same) cards</p><p>Rook City = 2 heroes * 41 cards&nbsp;+ 4 villains * 27 cards&nbsp;+ 2 env * 15 cards&nbsp;+ Operative card =&nbsp;221 cards</p><p>Infernal Relics = 2 heroes * 41 + 3 villains * 27 cards + 2 env * 15 cards + 35 Ennead cards = 228 cards</p><p>Promos = 1 hero * 41 cards, 1 villain * 27 cards, 4 hero promo cards, 4 promo villain cards = 76 cards</p><p>That makes 578 + (578 +) 221 + 228 + 76 = 1103 cards (1681 cards)</p><p>Also, 16 oversized villain cards have been released.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:14:31.088Z",
